  'm.johnsonsb.parresol': 'Parresol (2003): three-parameter recovery with ξ fixed',
  'prs.h': 'Johnson SB: Parresol (2003) recovery', 'prs.sub': 'ξ (lower bound) is a fixed value you give; λ, γ and δ are recovered from the mean diameter, the median and Dq (or the number of trees and basal area per hectare). γ from the median [γ = δ ln((ξ + λ − M)/(M − ξ))], λ and δ from the first and second raw moment equations. Parresol\'s species-specific regression coefficients, starting equations and lower-bound estimate from the three smallest diameters are not used.',
