  'pr.fns.symmetric': 'the median equals the mean (symmetric): the method reduces to three equations; the four parameters are not determined', 'pr.fns.weak': p => `the solution is weakly determined (Jacobian condition number ${p.cond.toExponential(1)} > 10⁸); no single result is given`,
